{
  "work_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses",
  "source_path": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses.json",
  "source_language": "cop",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.000.0009",
      "source_sha256": "99862ef305d6ea07",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They said to him, “Because no one has hired us.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.000.0064",
      "source_sha256": "4070f9f500aa25bb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Why was this ointment not sold for three hundred staters and the money given to the poor?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.000.0070",
      "source_sha256": "3f50d422e4b967cd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "This is God's defense concerning it: “Am I, God, not allowed to give greater wages to the one who works, and to judge those who act wickedly?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.000.0081",
      "source_sha256": "b9c65d7135a6821c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But he was showing his courage in facing the cross, as a strong martyr and as a fearless God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.000.0140",
      "source_sha256": "81454bcb31cc4502",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Now, then, let us give thanks to God and to the Holy Spirit,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.000.0141",
      "source_sha256": "60b2ae1571c2551b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "who opened the door of the Word for us and put speech in our mouths, so that we might say what the Word has graciously given us for the benefit of our souls and of those who listen to us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.000.0142",
      "source_sha256": "11fcf13854ffe308",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And let us bless the Word, who has graciously given us the Holy Spirit."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.000.0143",
      "source_sha256": "7d8458aa44ec1244",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He is also the one who said, “When they speak to you, do not worry about what you will say, for you will be given what to say at that hour."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.000.0144",
      "source_sha256": "67cc5023dcd3c11b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For it is not you who speak, but the Spirit of your Father who speaks within you.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.001.0002",
      "source_sha256": "e3dbb2f8896aecfb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "As the holy apostle says, “Just as they did not see fit to keep God rightly before them, God handed them over to a corrupt mind, to do what is improper.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.001.0004",
      "source_sha256": "aa2dd93e0c946f04",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Arrogant, boastful people who seek out evil."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.001.0020",
      "source_sha256": "2e4cbd525c6fe101",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Finally, here and now, let each person examine himself."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.001.0037",
      "source_sha256": "9b48622a5197e3c3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And they exist for the honor of human beings."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.001.0048",
      "source_sha256": "a122ab256778091d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "In this way he distributed his possessions among the poor."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.001.0055",
      "source_sha256": "c3640ffe2d5d6197",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He ordered it to be cut down, so that [?] waste the soil as well."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.001.0070",
      "source_sha256": "a8eb7fa2efad41a4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Through these, moreover, he promised them fellowship with himself."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.002.0014",
      "source_sha256": "1efaab62011687ee",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But Adam came under the power of death because of his transgression, and Adam's created form needed to be formed again by God the Creator, so that he might be saved."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.002.0049",
      "source_sha256": "dfa3dbe25f0b15cf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For when the soul departs from its body, it does not return to speak in a loud voice, but in a faint and very feeble voice."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.002.0062",
      "source_sha256": "855f2c5c7357aed0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For you cannot recognize Adam's bones, or which are the prophets' bones, or which bodies belong to the patriarchs or the apostles."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.002.0072",
      "source_sha256": "ac64b529ebab347b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The joy of those on earth lasts only a short time. Although they think it is great, it quickly vanishes from their grasp."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.002.0111",
      "source_sha256": "6bb7e822fd8eda80",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For it is a great sorrow to witness a person's death and decay."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.002.0151",
      "source_sha256": "adc13a6c5421ad33",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or what father has died for his own son whom he fathered?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.002.0157",
      "source_sha256": "e84a44b4583fbbfa",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But when we were ruined by sin, he came and suffered for us, and brought us to life through his love."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.002.0210",
      "source_sha256": "8a09c12f758ca2d1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "As they saw their God, who had created them, hanging on a tree like a robber."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.002.0231",
      "source_sha256": "fc7900fde098b783",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For creation could not bear his dead body, nor could the elements bear him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.002.0239",
      "source_sha256": "626ee1675b74520b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "They despise the one whom they cannot equal, and he does not become angry."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.002.0260",
      "source_sha256": "e4735e94b299b8c8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "Because you made me worthy to have your body buried within me in place of the blood they poured out upon me, so that you might raise them up."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.002.0261",
      "source_sha256": "5fddf9357dd4135a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "For they have scattered your honored image everywhere."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.002.0262",
      "source_sha256": "a9623dd627987c96",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "Yet if you had merely said it with your word, no one could have opposed your command. But your love compelled you to come to your creation."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.002.0263",
      "source_sha256": "40dc7715c0abe91e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "For look, you have stood upon the earth, searching for the members of your creation."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.002.0264",
      "source_sha256": "08a46eb80f9833c2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "Take the human being for yourself as a trust."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_athanasius_discourses#CopScr.pseudo-athanasius-discourses.002.0277",
      "source_sha256": "e5d922acdf6cb5eb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 7,
      "text": "He who created the heavenly Jerusalem sits upon the cherubim; he is the true bridegroom and the king of all ages."
    }
  ]
}
